entries[183858] = { ["name"] = "Schematic: Wormhole Generator: Shadowlands", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a Wormhole Generator: Shadowlands.\nRequires Shadowlands Engineering (70)\nRequires The Undying Army\n- Honored\nSell Price:\nWormhole Generator: Shadowlands\nBinds when used\nToy\nUse: Open a wormhole that allows the user to quickly travel to one of several fixed points within the Shadowlands. (15 Min Cooldown)\nRequires Shadowlands Engineering (1)\n\"CAUTION: Failure to operate within strict safety guidelines may result in... double death? Turbo death? Aliveness?\"\nSell Price:\nRequires Wormfed Gear Assembly (3), Mortal Coiled Spring (7), Handful of Laestrite Bolts (20), Elethium Ore (3), Solenium Ore (10), Oxxein Ore (10), Phaedrum Ore (10), Sinvyr Ore (10)" }
